T*
(ships, spaceship cockpits, and coral reef submarines with sensory aromatics and) Tj
T*
(soundscapes.) Tj
T*
(Test Phase: Evaluated child anxiety, sedation rates, and throughput in pilot children's) Tj
T*
(hospitals.) Tj
T*
(Measurable Results: Pediatric sedation rates plummeted from over 80% to less than 1%,) Tj
T*
(daily patient throughput increased by 30%, and patient satisfaction scores rose to 99%.) Tj
