([CASE STUDY 4: Redesigning Blood Glucose Meters for Elderly Diabetics]) Tj
T*
/F1 9 Tf
/F2 9.5 Tf
(-------------------------------------------------------------------------------------) Tj
T*
/F1 9 Tf
(Problem Context: Traditional glucometers required fine manual dexterity to handle tiny) Tj
T*
(test strips and read miniature LCD displays, resulting in frequent measurement errors) Tj
T*
(and skipped testing by geriatric patients.) Tj
T*
(Design Thinking Intervention:) Tj
T*
(Empathy Immersion: Designers wore petroleum-jelly coated glasses \(simulating cataracts\)) Tj
T*
(and taped thumb joints \(simulating arthritis\) to experience patient limitations) Tj
T*
(directly.) Tj
T*
(Define Phase: 'How might we enable elderly diabetic individuals with impaired vision and) Tj
T*
(tremor to test blood glucose independently and painlessly?') Tj
T*
(Prototyping & Testing: Designed oversized test strips with capillary sip-in channels,) Tj
T*
(high-contrast backlit screens with audio voice readout, and bluetooth auto-syncing to) Tj
T*
(family caregivers.) Tj
T*
(Measurable Results: User testing revealed a 92% reduction in sample application errors) Tj
T*
(and 98% independent testing adherence.) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
/F2 9.5 Tf
(>> 1.5 University Review & Examination Questions) Tj
T*
/F1 9 Tf
() Tj
T*
(* Q1: Contrast the Focused and Diffuse modes of thinking, explaining how their) Tj
T*
(rhythmic alternation catalyzes creative engineering breakthroughs.) Tj
T*
(Answer: Focused mode involves intense, concentrated attention within the prefrontal) Tj
T*
(cortex, operating along well-established neural pathways to execute logical) Tj
T*
(calculations, analyze details, and debug algorithms. Diffuse mode is a broad,) Tj
T*
(resting-state cognitive mode operating when the mind relaxes \(during exercise, sleep, or) Tj
T*
(daydreaming\), enabling the brain to synthesize high-level patterns across distant neural) Tj
T*
(regions. Creative breakthrough requires rhythmic alternation between both modes: focused) Tj
T*
(mode supplies raw domain facts and analytical framing; diffuse mode reconciles disparate) Tj
T*
(concepts to uncover novel perspectives; returning to focused mode verifies, refines, and) Tj
T*
(executes the creative solution.) Tj
T*
(* Q2: Explain the IDEO Human-Centered Design framework, illustrating the Three Lenses) Tj
T*
(of Innovation with a real-world software engineering product.) Tj
T*
(Answer: The IDEO framework assesses innovation through three essential lenses: \(1\)) Tj
T*
(Desirability: Does the solution solve a genuine, deeply felt human need? \(2\)) Tj
T*
ET

